WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.134
Chemical networks never run dry.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.320
Imagine a chemical soup.

3
00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.421
If every reaction can be undone, no species dies out or explodes.

4
00:00:08.571 --> 00:00:10.531
Every path enters one safe region.

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.862
Claimed: both conjectures proved, for fixed rate constants.

6
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.460
Lean covers only part of it.
